hand('Compressed infinity and overdrawn sigma','The two pole subscripts in (40) are vertical double loops, resembling xi at this scale; the defined pole notation supports infinity. This habit helps read the two occurrences here, not all squiggles. The sigma/tau in (43) is unusually overdrawn, unlike clear sigma in (44)–(45), and remains marked. Partial cancellation of auto must not be enlarged to the whole automorphisme.')
